Melewati urutan tersebut

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:22.080
membuat Anda harus

00:20:22.080 --> 00:20:22.580
menambah lubang

00:20:22.580 --> 00:20:23.560
setelah adopsi sudah berjalan.

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:25.100
Jika Anda hanya bisa

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:25.900
